# 默认拒绝：构建上下文仅含服务端及其锁定依赖；不发送凭证、资料和本机状态。
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!office-data-service/
!office-data-service/**
!packages/
!packages/api-contracts/
!packages/api-contracts/pyproject.toml
!packages/api-contracts/README.md
!packages/api-contracts/src/
!packages/api-contracts/src/**
!clients/
!clients/python/
!clients/python/pyproject.toml
!deploy/
!deploy/Dockerfile
# 白名单内仍排除本机产物和秘密。
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/.venv/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/credentials/**
**/secrets/**
**/runtime/**
**/*.egg-info/**

# 品牌配置只读构建核验；均为公开生成物，不含实例.env。
!VERSION
!template.toml
!template-state.json
!scripts/
!scripts/configure_template.py
!deploy/installer/
!deploy/installer/product.json
!deploy/identity/
!deploy/identity/**
!installers/
!installers/client/
!installers/client/product.json
!clients/python/src/
!clients/python/src/office_client/
!clients/python/src/office_client/product.json

# 最终拒绝规则优先于上面的公开文件白名单。
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/.venv/**
**/credentials/**
**/secrets/**
**/runtime/**

!contracts/
!contracts/openapi.json

# 自有与第三方许可随容器交付。
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!packages/api-contracts/LICENSE
!packages/api-contracts/NOTICE
